                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Selkies can transform between their original seal-like form and a human form. In human form, they have a land Speed of 25 feet and lose their swim Speed and jaws Strike. They gain the following unarmed attack:</p>\n<p><strong>Melee</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> fist +14 (agile, finesse, nonlethal, unarmed)</p>\n<p><strong>Damage</strong> 1d4+6 bludgeoning</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
                },
