                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. When a selkie is outside of their home waters, their yearning for home radiates from them. A creature that enters or starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:22] save or become unable to benefit from emotion effects for 1 minute (though they can still take penalties or damage from emotion effects); on a critical failure, the duration is 24 hours. Regardless of the result, the creature is temporarily immune to seaborn yearning for 24 hours.</p>"
